# Manual test file for TM-popup off-screen positioning (translate/virtaal#1366).
#
# Units 1-4 are translated so they can fuzzy-match the last unit via the
# 'Current File' TM model, at varying similarity - producing a MULTI-ROW
# popup (closer to a real worst case) rather than a single suggestion.
# Navigate to the LAST unit (near-duplicate of unit 1) in a tall/
# maximized window - it should trigger a multi-match TM suggestion
# popup. Check whether the popup renders fully on-screen and clear of
# the source text.
